module jev_calibration_outcome_window_observation_lsp

input status
input target_stage
input record_digest
input reason

status INFORMATION for BOUND outcome-window evidence
status HINT for DEFERRED outcome-window evidence
status ERROR for UNKNOWN or missing outcome evidence

field code
field severity

constraint inspection_only
constraint metric_projection
constraint read_only
constraint no_edits
constraint no_command
constraint no_execution
constraint no_authorization